        </ul>
      
        <div class="section-title">Group</div>
        <ul class="menu-items">
            <li><a href="members.html">Members</a></li>
            <li><a href="alumni.html">Alumni</a></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="main-content">
        <h1>Baojun Liu</h1>
      
        <div class="profile">
            <img src="assets/images/photo-2025.jpg" alt="Profile Photo" class="profile-image">
            <div class="profile-info">
                <h2>Baojun Liu</h2>
                <p class="position">Associate Professor</p>
                <p class="department">Institute for Network Sciences and Cyberspace</p>
                <p class="institution">Tsinghua University</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Welcome</h2>
        <p>I am the Director of the Network and Information System Security Lab (NISL) and an Associate Professor at the Institute for Network Sciences and Cyberspace, Tsinghua University. My team works on Internet Measurement and Network Security, with a focus on uncovering and mitigating real-world threats to the global Internet infrastructure and applications.</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            <div class="section-title">Students and Postdocs:</div>
            <p>I am looking for highly motivated students and postdoctoral researchers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-section">
            <h2>Contact Information</h2>
            <p>Institute for Network Sciences and Cyberspace<br>
            Room 3-228, FIT Building<br>
            Tsinghua University<br>
            Beijing 100084, China</p>
            <p>Email: lbj  at   tsinghua.edu.cn<br>
            Web: <a href="https://www.insc.tsinghua.edu.cn/info/1157/3432.htm" target="_blank">https://www.insc.tsinghua.edu.cn/info/1157/3432.htm</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>